# Optional: point the deployed client at a specific multiplayer server.
#
# By default the client auto-detects the server:
#   - Local dev (Vite on :8080)     -> connects to localhost:3001
#   - Deployed on Railway (single service serving the game + socket.io)
#                                  -> connects to the SAME origin (no config needed)
#
# Set VITE_SERVER_URL ONLY if you split the client and server onto different hosts
# (e.g. client on GitHub Pages, server on Railway). It is baked in at BUILD time:
#
# VITE_SERVER_URL=https://your-service.up.railway.app
